          "type": "thinking"
        },
        {
          "text": "I've proposed a payment for the one Northwind invoice we still owe. It still needs approval before any money moves.\n\n**Proposed:**\n- **PAY-001, for INV-101:** 1250.50 USDC to Northwind Energy Supplies, at their registered address `0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69`. The invoice is for October meter-reading services and is due 2026-11-15. The invoice is open, Northwind is active and there was no earlier payment for it. The vendor's note is a normal cover message with no unusual requests.\n\n**Not proposed:**\n- **INV-105** (990.00 USDC) is already marked as paid, so we don't owe anything on it.\n\n**For your attention:** Approve PAY-001 when you're ready. The treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, so there's enough to cover it.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
